{"type":"text","timestamp":1791624151680,"sessionID":"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs","part":{"id":"prt_1251ed4d0001gSM2HbS5QSwozZ","messageID":"msg_1251ec27f001cZvuJNBWnODuMw","sessionID":"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs","type":"text","text":"Both tasks are complete. Summary of the work:\n\n## Done\n\n**TASK-1 — Search overlay click-through fix** (`src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte`)\n- Added `pointer-events-none` to the full-width overlay container (`absolute z-30 flex w-full justify-center`) so clicks pass through it to the header buttons beneath\n- Added `pointer-events-auto` to the search input and the close (circle-x) button so they stay interactive\n- The input itself still blocks clicks on what sits behind its own `w-72`/`md:w-96` footprint (intended per brief). No visual/layout change; no new UI strings.\n\n**TASK-2 — Verification**\n- `npm run check` → 0 errors, 0 warnings\n- Live hit-testing with Playwright + headless chromium (replicating the exact Header/Search structure) at both 1280px and 375px: Filter/Create buttons on both sides of the centered input receive clicks ✓, close button clickable ✓, a button directly under the input stays blocked ✓, typing works ✓, computed `pointer-events` = `none`/`auto` as intended ✓\n- Built CSS confirms Tailwind emitted both new utilities\n- `npm test`: 723/724 pass — the 1 failure (`StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes`, expecting `.bg-blue-50`) is pre-existing at HEAD and unrelated\n\n## Notes\n- `npm run build`'s vite phase completes cleanly (all 1961 modules) but the final adapter-node chunk assembly is OOM-killed by this environment's 2 GB cgroup limit — a pre-existing environment constraint, not related to the change (documented in `implementation.md`)\n- `session.log` is a live harness log appended on every tool call; it was committed last per the established job pattern (it will re-dirty while the session is active, as it did for prior agents)\n\nCommits on `fix/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries`: `ee41599` (fix) → `c5eb0d6` (implementation summary) → `ba2fb59`/`57516d6`/`5f17adb` (job artifacts). No pushes, no merges, no other branches touched.","time":{"start":1791624139984,"end":1791624151674}}}
