\\n57e3861 [lot] chore: commit all\\n\",\"metadata\":{\"output\":\"[fix/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries 5f17adb] [lot] chore: commit all\\n 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)\\n5f17adb [lot] chore: commit all\\n57516d6 [lot] chore: commit all\\nba2fb59 [lot] chore: commit all\\nc5eb0d6 [lot] implementation: add summary\\nee41599 fix(libraries): make search overlay click-through so header buttons stay clickable\\n44b5236 [lot] chore: commit all\\n57e3861 [lot] chore: commit all\\n\",\"exit\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"git add docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/session.log && git commit -m \\\"[lot] chore: commit all\\\" && git log --oneline -7\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791624135112,\"end\":1791624135188}},\"id\":\"prt_1251ebf42001D8fOtJ4LQuFg15\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1251e91e4001tS9Ysac3MqC0od\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791624135299,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1251ec266001nSPBHX4YKscAr6\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1251e91e4001tS9Ysac3MqC0od\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":52397,\"input\":2952,\"output\":549,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":48896}},\"cost\":0.000918888}}\n+{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1791624136341,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1251ec68e001wY6XO07pkG9iWz\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1251ec27f001cZvuJNBWnODuMw\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1791624151680,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1251ed4d0001gSM2HbS5QSwozZ\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1251ec27f001cZvuJNBWnODuMw\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Both tasks are complete. Summary of the work:\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n**TASK-1 — Search overlay click-through fix** (`src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte`)\\n- Added `pointer-events-none` to the full-width overlay container (`absolute z-30 flex w-full justify-center`) so clicks pass through it to the header buttons beneath\\n- Added `pointer-events-auto` to the search input and the close (circle-x) button so they stay interactive\\n- The input itself still blocks clicks on what sits behind its own `w-72`/`md:w-96` footprint (intended per brief). No visual/layout change; no new UI strings.\\n\\n**TASK-2 — Verification**\\n- `npm run check` → 0 errors, 0 warnings\\n- Live hit-testing with Playwright + headless chromium (replicating the exact Header/Search structure) at both 1280px and 375px: Filter/Create buttons on both sides of the centered input receive clicks ✓, close button clickable ✓, a button directly under the input stays blocked ✓, typing works ✓, computed `pointer-events` = `none`/`auto` as intended ✓\\n- Built CSS confirms Tailwind emitted both new utilities\\n- `npm test`: 723/724 pass — the 1 failure (`StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes`, expecting `.bg-blue-50`) is pre-existing at HEAD and unrelated\\n\\n## Notes\\n- `npm run build`'s vite phase completes cleanly (all 1961 modules) but the final adapter-node chunk assembly is OOM-killed by this environment's 2 GB cgroup limit — a pre-existing environment constraint, not related to the change (documented in `implementation.md`)\\n- `session.log` is a live harness log appended on every tool call; it was committed last per the established job pattern (it will re-dirty while the session is active, as it did for prior agents)\\n\\nCommits on `fix/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries`: `ee41599` (fix) → `c5eb0d6` (implementation summary) → `ba2fb59`/`57516d6`/`5f17adb` (job artifacts). No pushes, no merges, no other branches touched.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1791624139984,\"end\":1791624151674}}}\n+{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1791624151776,\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1251f02c2001SNCXovV7bR3UYO\",\"reason\":\"stop\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1251ec27f001cZvuJNBWnODuMw\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_edaee7027ffeOfy6SFj11X94rs\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":53224,\"input\":315,\"output\":685,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":52224}},\"cost\":0.000614922}}\ndiff --git a/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/tasks.md b/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/tasks.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..3c40c43\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/tasks.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@\n+# Tasks: search bar overlays buttons in libraries\n+\n+id: lot\n+analyst: @analyst\n+date: 2026-10-10\n+\n+<!-- Produced by @analyst from brief.md. -->\n+\n+## Root cause\n+\n+`src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte` renders its inline search input\n+inside an absolutely positioned, full-width, transparent container:\n+\n+```\n+<div class=\"absolute z-30 flex w-full justify-center\">\n+```\n+\n+When `library.searchVisible` is true, this container floats above the whole header\n+row (the same header that holds Filter / Releases / Recommender / genre-edit /\n+Create buttons, rendered by `libraries/shared/Header.svelte`). The container has no\n+background, so the buttons stay visible, but it intercepts every click across the\n+header width, making them unclickable — exactly what the brief describes.\n+\n+`Search.svelte` is the only inline search implementation for libraries (used only by\n+`shared/Header.svelte`, which all eight library pages route through); the separate\n+`LibrarySearchModal.svelte` is a modal and is not affected.\n+\n+Fix: make the overlay container click-through (`pointer-events-none`) and restore\n+pointer events only on the input and the close button (`pointer-events-auto`). The\n+input itself keeps blocking clicks underneath it (with `inputExpanded`, `w-72` /\n+`md:w-96`), which per the brief is the correct behaviour. Visual layout is unchanged.\n+\n+## Task breakdown\n+\n+TASK-1: In `Search.svelte`, add `pointer-events-none` to the search-overlay container\n+     (`absolute z-30 flex w-full justify-center`) and `pointer-events-auto` to the\n+     search input and to the close (circle-x) button, so only the actual input area\n+     blocks clicks while the search is open and the rest of the header stays clickable.\n+     files: src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte\n+     depends: none\n+     risk: low — one-file, CSS-class-only change; no visual or logic change, no new\n+     UI strings (no i18n impact). Also closes the same click-blocking during the\n+     collapsed/fade-in state (`w-0` input) for free.\n+\n+TASK-2: Verify the fix: run `npm run check` (+ `npm run build`) and manually confirm\n+     that with the search open, the header buttons (Filter, Releases, Recommender,\n+     genre edit, Create — desktop and mobile variants) and the ViewSwitcher remain\n+     clickable on both sides of the centered input, at desktop and mobile widths,\n+     and that typing in the input still works and blocks what sits behind it.\n+     files: none (verification only — no code change expected)\n+     depends: TASK-1\n+     risk: low — verification task; jsdom cannot model pointer-event hit-testing, so a\n+     component test would not genuinely validate the click-through, and no such test\n+     exists for this component today.\n+\n+## Notes for the developer\n+\n+- Do not change the container's `w-full`, the input widths, or the z-indices —\n+  the visual layout is intentional (centered search bar over a full-width header).\n+  The only required change is pointer-event behaviour.\n+- An alternative (constraining the container width to the input's width) is a valid\n+  approach but wider-reaching and more fragile across breakpoints (input `w-72` vs\n+  `md:w-96` + the 30px close-button overhang); prefer TASK-1's pointer-events fix.\n+- Re-opening the search by clicking the magnifier icon while the overlay is open is\n+  a no-op and stays harmless after the change.\n\\ No newline at end of file\ndiff --git a/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/tokens.json b/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/tokens.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..7e15669\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/tokens.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+[\n+  {\n+    \"agent\": \"analyst\",\n+    \"attempt\": 1,\n+    \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-10T09:07:47.4175635Z\",\n+    \"inputTokens\": 40912,\n+    \"outputTokens\": 10347,\n+    \"cacheReadTokens\": 314112,\n+    \"costUSD\": 0.013287336000000002\n+  }\n+]\n\\ No newline at end of file\ndiff --git a/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/verdict.md b/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/verdict.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..9617c51\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/docs/jobs/lot_search-bar-overlays-buttons-in-libraries/verdict.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@\n+# Verdict: search bar overlays buttons in libraries\n+\n+id: lot\n+reviewer:\n+date:\n+\n+<!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\n+\n+## Review\n+\n+<!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\n+     notes: ...\n+\n+TASK-2: ...\n+-->\n+\n+## Security\n+\n+<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \"none\" if not run. -->\n+\n+## Overall\n+\n+<!-- APPROVED / REJECTED / NEEDS WORK -->\n+<!-- Summary of what needs to change before this can be approved, if anything. -->\ndiff --git a/src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte b/src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte\nindex ea37f7a..fd6eb06 100644\n--- a/src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte\n+++ b/src/lib/components/libraries/shared/Search.svelte\n@@ -58,10 +58,10 @@\n </button>\n \n {#if library.searchVisible}\n-\t<div class=\"absolute z-30 flex w-full justify-center\">\n+\t<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-30 flex w-full justify-center\">\n \t\t<input\n \t\t\ttype=\"text\"\n-\t\t\tclass=\"w-0 rounded-xl border-1 border-c-neutral-2 !bg-c-neutral/60 text-xl backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 dark:!bg-s-dark/80\"\n+\t\t\tclass=\"pointer-events-auto w-0 rounded-xl border-1 border-c-neutral-2 !bg-c-neutral/60 text-xl backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 dark:!bg-s-dark/80\"\n \t\t\tclass:w-72={inputExpanded}\n \t\t\tclass:md:w-96={inputExpanded}\n \t\t\tin:fade\n@@ -70,7 +70,7 @@\n \t\t\t{oninput}\n \t\t/>\n \t\t<button\n-\t\t\tclass=\"z-20 ml-[-30px] cursor-pointer text-c-neutral-3 hover:text-c-neutral-5\"\n+\t\t\tclass=\"pointer-events-auto z-20 ml-[-30px] cursor-pointer text-c-neutral-3 hover:text-c-neutral-5\"\n \t\t\tonclick={closeSearch}\n \t\t>\n \t\t\t<IconCircleX />\n","exit":0,"truncated":true,"outputPath":"/home/claude/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_1251f3d68001FDkRUzNdf0US7N"},"title":"git diff main...HEAD","time":{"start":1791624166705,"end":1791624167080}},"id":"prt_1251f3cf8001DabZx5NDrn6LBD","sessionID":"ses_edae0eac3ffeMK1M7G94zFEyN9","messageID":"msg_1251f364e001Cpd7jjR4AHYDxX"}}
